   <div class="container section-top centered" style="color:white" id="section-top"> 
      <p>
         Right from its inception in <span class="num-font">1986,</span> Vascon's primary business has been EPC (Engineering, Procurement and Construction). Today, more than <span class="num-font">37+</span> years down the road, the Company is a name to reckon with in EPC, with an impressive portfolio of achievements - not just for its own projects but for third parties too. From sprawling factories and state-of-the-art hospitals to glittering hotels and malls,  elegant office and residential complexes to towring IT parks and colleges. Vascon's capabilities are visible across the cityscape.            
      </p>
      <p>
         The Company has executed more than <span class="num-font">200</span> projects with construction area over <span class="num-font">50</span> million sq.ft. and made in roads into Government Contracts too, delivering consistently high quality standards and timely execution of projects. Repeat orders from clients stand eloquent testimony to value delivered.           
      </p>
   </div>
